:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Chastity Widgets [widget]

<!-- 堕落仪式结束后，PC 可以询问 Sydney 是否愿意重新佩戴贞操带。 -->
<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-sydney-chastity-refit-link'>>
  <<if $location is 'temple'
    and isLoveInterest('Sydney')
    and $sydneySeen.includes('corruptroom')
    and $templePromised isnot 'Sydney'
    and !C.npc.Sydney.chastity.penis.includes('chastity')
    and !C.npc.Sydney.chastity.vagina.includes('chastity')
    and !$temple_evaluation>>
    <<lockicon>><<lanLink
      'Ask Sydney about wearing a chastity belt again (0:15)'
      'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Chastity Refit'
    >><<pass 15>><</lanLink>>
    <br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Chastity Refit []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
<<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You ask Sydney whether <<he>> ever thought about Jordan's offer
      to replace <<his>> chastity belt.
      <<He>> stiffens, one hand settling over the empty space at <<his>> waist.
      <br><br>
      "I don't regret being with you," <<he>> says quickly.
      "But I regret stealing the key and lying to Jordan.
      When Jordan offered me another belt, I pretended not to hear.
      I think I was afraid of facing the lie."
      <br><br>
      <<He>> takes your hand. "I don't want to hide from it anymore.
      If I put it back on, it has to be because I choose to. I think I'm ready."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你问悉尼，<<he>>是否考虑过约旦提出的建议，重新戴上一条贞操带。
      <<He>>的身体微微一僵，一只手落在腰间空荡荡的位置。
      <br><br>
      “我不后悔和你在一起。”<<he>>急忙说道，
      “但我后悔偷了钥匙，也后悔欺骗约旦。
      约旦提出再给我一条贞操带时，我假装没有听见。
      我想，我那时只是不敢面对自己的谎言。”
      <br><br>
      <<He>>牵住你的手。“我不想再逃避了。
      如果要重新戴上，那必须是因为我自己愿意。
      我想，我已经准备好了。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<lockicon>><<lanLink
    'Go with Sydney to Jordan'
    'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Chastity Fitting'
  >><</lanLink>>
  <br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink 'Not yet' 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
<<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You ask Sydney whether <<he>> ever thought about wearing a chastity belt again.
      <<He>> stares at you, then gives an incredulous laugh.
      <br><br>
      "Put it back on? After everything we did to get it off?"
      <<He>> takes your hand and presses it against the empty space at <<his>> waist.
      "No. I want you to be able to touch me whenever we want.
      I'm not letting the temple lock me away from you again."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你问悉尼，<<he>>是否考虑过重新戴上一条贞操带。
      <<He>>盯着你看了一会儿，难以置信地笑出声来。
      <br><br>
      “戴回去？我们费了那么大劲才把它摘下来？”
      <<He>>牵过你的手，按在<<his>>腰间空荡荡的位置。
      “不要。我想让你在我们愿意的时候，随时都能碰我。
      我不会再让神殿把我锁起来，不许你碰了。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink 'Return to the temple' 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You ask Sydney whether <<he>> ever thought about accepting Jordan's offer
      to replace <<his>> chastity belt.
      <<He>> falls silent, fingers brushing the empty space at <<his>> waist.
      <br><br>
      "I don't know," <<he>> says at last. "I know Jordan offered, but I'm not ready
      to wear one again. Not after everything that happened. Please don't ask me yet."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你问悉尼，<<he>>是否考虑过接受约旦的提议，重新戴上一条贞操带。
      <<He>>沉默下来，手指轻轻擦过腰间空荡荡的位置。
      <br><br>
      “我不知道。”<<he>>终于开口说道，
      “我知道约旦提过这件事，但经历了那些事以后，
      我还没准备好重新戴上。
      暂时别再问我了，好吗？”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink 'Return to the temple' 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Chastity Fitting []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<npc Sydney 1>><<npc Jordan 2>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You accompany Sydney to Jordan. Sydney asks whether the offer to replace <<his>> chastity belt
    still stands. Jordan studies <<him>> for a moment, then gives a solemn nod.
    <br><br>
    "I remember my offer," <<nnpc_he 'Jordan'>> says. "Have you given this proper thought?"
    <br><br>
    <<person1>>Sydney nods. "I have. I want another one fitted."
    <br><br>
    Jordan leads you behind a screen beside the vestry and asks Sydney to raise <<his>> habit.
    From a locked case, <<nnpc_he 'Jordan'>> removes a silver chastity belt and matching shield,
    both the same design as Sydney's old device. <<nnpc_He 'Jordan'>> checks each fitting
    before fastening the belt around <<person1>><<his>> waist. The lock closes with a heavy click.
    <br><br>
    Sydney tests the edges with <<his>> fingertips, then lets <<his>> habit fall back into place.
    <<He>> exhales at the familiar weight.
    <br><br>
    "If it causes you pain, come to me," Jordan says.
    "There is no virtue in suffering through an ill-fitting restraint."
    <<nnpc_He 'Jordan'>> leaves you together.
    <br><br>
    Sydney leans against you once Jordan is gone.
    "It feels strange," <<he>> whispers, "but this time, I chose it."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你陪悉尼来到约旦面前。悉尼问，重新佩戴贞操带的提议是否依然有效。
    约旦端详<<him>>片刻，郑重地点点头。
    <br><br>
    “我记得自己的提议。”<<nnpc_he 'Jordan'>>说道，“你认真考虑过了吗？”
    <br><br>
    <<person1>>悉尼点点头。“想过了。我想重新戴上一条。”
    <br><br>
    约旦把你们领到法衣室旁的屏风后，让悉尼掀起<<his>>的修士服。
    <<nnpc_he 'Jordan'>>从上锁的箱子里取出一条银制贞操带和配套的护盾，
    款式与悉尼原来的装置相同。
    <<nnpc_He 'Jordan'>>仔细检查各处贴合情况，
    随后将贞操带扣在<<person1>><<his>>腰间。
    锁扣发出沉重的咔哒声。
    <br><br>
    悉尼用指尖试了试边缘，才放下修士服。
    熟悉的重量令<<him>>缓缓吐出一口气。
    <br><br>
    “如果它让你感到疼痛，就来找我。”约旦说道，
    “忍受不合身的束具并不是什么美德。”
    <<nnpc_He 'Jordan'>>留下你们二人，独自离开。
    <br><br>
    约旦离开后，悉尼靠在你身上。“感觉有些奇怪。”<<he>>低声说道，
    “但这一次，是我自己的选择。”
<</language>>
<<set C.npc.Sydney.chastity.penis to 'chastity belt'>>
<<set C.npc.Sydney.chastity.vagina to 'chastity belt'>>
<<set C.npc.Sydney.chastity.anus to 'anal shield'>>
<<set $sydneyChastityKnown to true>>
<<unset $sydneyChastityRemoveIntro>>
<<unset $sydneyChastityRemovePure>>
<<unset $sydneyChastityRemoveCorrupt>>
<br><br>
<<endevent>><<npc Sydney>><<person1>>
<<lanLink 'Return to the temple' 'Temple'>><</lanLink>>
